{"id":"wb-6-146","name":"轵国故城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"轵国故城","text":"轵国故城曾是轵国的都城，位于今河南省济源市南部轵城镇，春秋时期是东周畿内的领地，到了战国时期曾是韩国的国都。秦代在这里设轵县，隶属于三川郡。北朝始封轵国于此。近代被列为河南全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%BD%B5%E5%9B%BD%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":86761706,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86761706","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d52887e3ea3d06c0f2b87003.jpg","title":"Jiyuan_Zhiguo_Gucheng_2018.12.19_14-49-43.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jiyuan_Zhiguo_Gucheng_2018.12.19_14-49-43.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/Jiyuan_Zhiguo_Gucheng_2018.12.19_14-49-43.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​济源·轵国故城","width":320,"height":213}}